    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38143" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-ungo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, unctum, 3, v.
				a., <i>to smear</i> or <i>anoint before</i> (post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praeungendum est vulnus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Theod. Prisc. 1, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">digitus praeunctus adipe anserino,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Tard. 4, 3, 45</span></i>
			.</div>
